WEBVTT

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:01.738
Parece-me que essa é uma forma

00:17:01.738 --> 00:17:03.927
de começar a restaurar

00:17:03.927 --> 00:17:06.236
a arte da discussão democrática.

00:17:06.236 --> 00:17:07.673
Muito obrigado.

00:17:07.917 --> 00:17:11.278
(Aplausos)

00:17:11.696 --> 00:17:12.916
Obrigado.

00:17:13.212 --> 00:17:16.510
(Aplausos)

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.792
Obrigado.

00:17:17.862 --> 00:17:20.213
(Aplausos)

00:17:20.213 --> 00:17:21.738
Muito obrigado.

00:17:21.738 --> 00:17:23.413
Muito obrigado.

00:17:23.413 --> 00:17:25.427
(Aplausos)

00:17:25.427 --> 00:17:26.643
Chris...

00:17:26.643 --> 00:17:27.900
Obrigado, Chris.

00:17:29.793 --> 00:17:32.438
Chris Anderson: Das flautas 
para os relvados do golfe,